        <referenceFunction amount="1.0" category="construction" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="The dataset is applicable in the construction building sector. Bitumen sealing is used to protect the construction against water intrusion.;&#10;UUID: 91660580-4c03-3aca-b660-3c8f03747cad" includedProcesses="The dataset describes the production of bitumen sealing VA4. Included processes are the extrusion of polypropylene foil, the fabrication of the sealing, the infrastructure, the transport by road and rail as well as the disposal of the bitumen cuttings in a municipal incineration. The production of bitumen sealing does not include any chemical processes. In this specific type of bitumen sealing VA4, aluminium is being sputtered onto a PE-foil." infrastructureProcess="false" localCategory="construction" localName="Bitumen sealing VA4, at plant" localSubCategory="sealing" name="Bitumen sealing VA4, at plant" subCategory="sealing" unit="kg"/>
